	1. Pipeline Description
		a. filter MSM_MergedSource_$$SubmitName$$.txt with valid query, keyword from DecileQuery, BroadBidAdCorpus in module: JoinDecile_DE_Blacklist
		b. diff with two blackList: MSMBlackListQK.txt & $$SubmitName$$/Blacklist.txt in module: JoinDecile_DE_Blacklist
		c. preprocess data and generate several features for next scoring steps in module: [Exp][QK]FeaturePreprocessor_L1, [Exp][QK]FeatureGenerator_1[L1] & [Exp][QK]FeatureGenerator_2[L1]
		d. Scoring data with 3 models: Rank, CTR, AD, generate 3 scores for every row in module: L1Rank_Blacklist
		e. select scoring result satisfying three Scorethresholds, referred as QKAfterThreshold in module: L1Rank_Blacklist
		f. select top300 from QKAfterThreshold according to RankScore, CTRScore respectively and merge two results, referred as OutputPath in module: L1Rank_Blacklist
		g. merge last $$SubmitName$$/Blacklist.txt of which date is less then 30 days, scoring result disSatisfying Scorethresholds and rank of CTRScore larger than 1800 in previous step in module: L1Rank_Blacklist
		h. output merged Blacklist.txt to $$END_DATE$$/$$SubmitName$$/Blacklist.txt in module: ScopeOneInput
		i. select top250 with biggest bid for every q from QKAfterThreshold of step e, output to Output1 in module: ScopeThreeInput_Generic
		j. merge Output1 from step i with OutputPath from step f, output to Output3, which means recalling data with high bid, but filtered by rank of RankScore & CTRScore in module: ScopeThreeInput_Generic
		k. left several MSMPruning modules are used to filter source according to entity match algos 
		l. filter OutputPath from step f with result of step k in module: ScopeTwoInputs_SetExpiry_TPN, nodeId is 6e7019ea
		m. filter Output1 from step i with result of step k in module: ScopeTwoInputs_SetExpiry_TPN, nodeId is dae8635a
		n. compute several metric of result of step l in module: [Dashboard]SingleStream_GetMetrics
		o. merge last Exp_Cleaned_Aggregate_L1_V2.1_V2.1_V1.1.txt with result of step l, do some diff and 
		output to $$END_DATE$$/$$SubmitName$$/Exp_Cleaned_Aggregate_L1_V2.1_V2.1_V1.1.txt in module: ScopeTwoInputs_15Steps, nodeId is 0bbac516
		p. sort merged result by rankScore * CTRScore, save top300 biggest to $$END_DATE$$/$$SubmitName$$/Exp_Cleaned_HighRankScore_Aggregate_L1_V2.1_V2.1_V1.1_Top300.txt 
		in module: ScopeTwoInputs_15Steps, nodeId is 0bbac516
		q. sort merged result by CTRScore, save top300 biggest to $$END_DATE$$/$$SubmitName$$/Exp_Cleaned_HighCTRScore_Aggregate_L1_V2.1_V2.1_V1.1_Top300.txt 
		in module: ScopeTwoInputs_15Steps, nodeId is 0bbac516
		r. merge last highBid data with new ones and output to $$END_DATE$$/$$SubmitName$$/Exp_Cleaned_Aggregate_L1_V2.1_V2.1_V1.1_HighBid.txt in module: ScopeTwoInputs_15Steps, nodeId is 4853281a
		s. get latest 3 months query in decile 1-6 in module: [MSM_Flight_Refresh]PrepareDecileV2
		t. filter new result of highRank, highCTR, highBid with decileQuery 1-6 respectively, output three results as below in module: SaveDecile1-6Pairs
			i. Exp_Cleaned_Aggregate_L1_V2.1_V2.1_V1.1_HighBid.1-6.txt
			ii. Exp_Cleaned_HighCTRScore_Aggregate_L1_V2.1_V2.1_V1.1_Top300.1-6.txt
			iii. Exp_Cleaned_HighRankScore_Aggregate_L1_V2.1_V2.1_V1.1_Top300.1-6.txt
